@startuml sd-install
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Malgun Gothic"
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
hide footbox
mainframe sd 사운드 설치 (SoundEffects.install)

participant ":Life" as L
participant "SoundEffects" as SC
participant "MidiSystem" as MS
participant "effects : SoundEffects" as S
participant ":Universe" as U
participant "noteScheduler :\nScheduledExecutorService" as Q
participant "MenuSite" as M

note over L, M : 모두 Swing 이벤트 스레드에서 실행된다

L -> SC : install(universe)
SC -> MS : getSynthesizer()

alt getSynthesizer()나 open()에서 MidiUnavailableException
  MS --> SC : MidiUnavailableException
  SC --> L : "Sound disabled" 출력 후 반환
  note right of L : 리스너도 메뉴도 등록하지 않는다.\n게임은 소리 없이 그대로 실행된다
else 신시사이저를 열었음
  MS --> SC : synthesizer
  SC -> SC : synthesizer.open()
  create S
  SC -> S : new SoundEffects(universe, synthesizer)
  S -> S : 채널 9개 할당\n(생성음 5, 대량 생성, 패드, 재생선, 타악기)
  create Q
  S -> Q : <<create>>\nExecutors.newSingleThreadScheduledExecutor()
  S -> S : applyInstruments()
  S -> S : settings.onInstrumentChange(\n() -> noteScheduler.execute(applyInstruments))
  S --> SC

  SC -> U : addBoardChangeListener(effects)
  U -> S : onBoardChanged(INITIAL 이벤트)
  S -> S : latestCells = event.copyAliveCells()
  S --> U
  U --> SC

  SC -> Q : scheduleAtFixedRate(effects::playStep, 0, 150ms)
  note right of Q : 첫 스텝 전에 INITIAL로\n판을 받아 두었으므로\nlatestCells는 비어 있지 않다

  SC -> S : createMenus()
  S -> M : addLine(Sound, On / Off / Settings)
  SC --> L
end
@enduml
